<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Dec company investment rose 6.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Belgian Dec company investment rose 6.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Office released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for Decmeber -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT	 Dec 96  Nov     Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)    351.4   202.3   328.6</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	   6.9     2.1</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT	 Jan-Dec period  Jan-Nov period</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	   5.4		 5.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Non-industrial investments rose 3.0 percent in the first 12 months, industrial investments rose 9.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
